":"எவ்வழி","parts":[{"text":"எவ்வழி","lemma":"எவ்வழி","gloss":"in whichever place"}],"gloss":"in whichever place","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நல்லவர்","parts":[{"text":"நல்லவர்","lemma":"நல்லவர்","gloss":"good people"}],"gloss":"good people"},{"surface":"ஆடவர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடவர்","lemma":"ஆடவர்","gloss":"men"}],"gloss":"men"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அவ்வழி","parts":[{"text":"அவ்வழி","lemma":"அவ்வழி","gloss":"in that place"}],"gloss":"in that place","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நல்லை","parts":[{"text":"நல்லை","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"you are good"}],"gloss":"you are good"},{"surface":"வாழிய","parts":[{"text":"வாழிய","lemma":"வாழு","gloss":"may you prosper"}],"gloss":"may you prosper"},{"surface":"நிலனே","parts":[{"text":"நிலன்","lemma":"நிலம்","gloss":"land"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"vocative particle"}],"gloss":"O land!"}]}],"literal":"Whether a country / or whether a forest / Whether a lowland / or whether a highland / In whichever place men are good / In that place you are good, may you prosper, O land!","translation":"Whether you are a cultivated country or a wild forest, whether you are a low valley or a high hill, wherever the men are good, there you are good too. May you prosper, O land!","modern":"நாடாக இருந்தால் என்ன, காடாக இருந்தால் என்ன? பள்ளமாக இருந்தால் என்ன, மேடாக இருந்தால் என்ன? எங்கே ஆண்கள் நல்லவர்களாக இருக்கிறார்களோ, அங்கே நீயும் நல்லதாக இருக்கிறாய். நிலமே, நீ வாழ்க!","explanation":"In this famous poem from the Puṟanāṉūṟu, the poet Avvaiyār addresses the land itself to deliver a profound moral truth. She argues that the value of a place does not depend on its physical geography, whether it is a fertile country, a wild forest, a low valley, or a high hill. Instead, the character and virtue of the people who inhabit the land determine its worth. If the people are good and righteous, the land itself becomes good and prosperous. By personifying the land and wishing it well, the poet emphasizes that human virtue is the true measure of any civilization.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}